  "question": {
    "text": "A closed cylindrical can has to be made with <math><mn>100</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> of plastic. If its volume is maximum, then the ratio of its radius to the height is",
